A chatbot that “saves sales” by giving discounts to everyone may destroy margin.

---

# 22. Root-Cause Extraction

Customer service must not only resolve incidents.

It must detect upstream defects.

Repeated questions may indicate:

PRODUCT PAGE DEFECT
POLICY DEFECT
SHIPPING DEFECT
PRODUCT QUALITY DEFECT
UX DEFECT
BILLING DEFECT
FULFILLMENT DEFECT

Every recurring issue should be eligible for upstream problem creation.

---

